# tools/hyperframes: HyperFrames video source. DENY BY DEFAULT.
#
# Only source file types are tracked. Media (mp4, mov, mp3, wav, png renders,
# footage, snapshots) can never enter git from here, whatever folder a tool
# invents next. That is the failure mode the tools/video-editor block in the
# root .gitignore describes: one >100 MB blob makes a branch unpushable.
*
!*/
!*.html
!*.css
!*.js
!*.mjs
!*.cjs
!*.md
!*.json
!*.svg
!.gitignore

# Small UI reference frames the kit SPEC cites (kept deliberately, <1 MB total).
!kits/*/reference/*.png

# Derived or local-only, even when the extension is allowed.
kits/*/components/
kits/*/gallery/compositions/components/ptah-ui-*.html
**/snapshots/
**/renders/
**/.hyperframes/
**/.media/
**/node_modules/
**/beats/
**/assets/footage/
**/assets/stills/
kits/*/scratch-*/
